      "comment": "CAPTAIN PAPRIKA (3) finished second at this track two starts back then did a great job again at his latest appearance over 2190m at at the same circuit, beaten 2.75 metres into second as the $2.20 favourite when trying to lead al of the way. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. It doesn't get any easier but on his best form he is capable of another big performance. SPRINGFIELD RIVER (6) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 5.5 metres from the winner in fourth over 1690m at Maryborough. Meets a comparable field and in his first run at this track can figure in the finish. ACCELERE NZ (5) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when he finished fifth at this track over 2190m after racing outside the leader at the bell. FLEUR BELLA (4) is the best of the rest after finishing third over 2190m at this track last time out after she raced in behind the leader at the bell.",
